    "findings": [
      {
        "class": "OMISSION",
        "note": "The entry is typed as a procedure but drops the source's actual procedures: the PTC account creation path, the guardian's Add a Child path, and the six-step Player ID generation flow. Load-bearing detail lost with them: a competitor who already holds an Organizer-issued Player ID must select 'I have a Player ID' and supply both the Player ID and a corresponding PIN. A reader following the entry has no way to complete the task it describes.",
