        "class": "DRIFT",
        "note": "Source expectation is 'Be free from the influence of mind-altering substances, including alcohol' — a bar on being under the influence. The entry renders it 'stay free of mind-altering substances, alcohol included', which reads as total abstinence and conflicts with section 3.2, where only the sale or use of alcohol *in the play area(s)* is prohibited.",
