    "findings": [
      {
        "class": "OMISSION",
        "note": "The source's opening sentence — 'Larger Championship Series events may run over two or three days, with a portion of the highest-ranking competitors advancing to a second phase of Swiss rounds' — is dropped entirely. Nothing in the entry conveys that a two-phase event spans multiple days, which is the practical fact a competitor planning attendance needs from this section.",
